          {
            "id": 2770016,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Hi. Great to see you. I'm Jody, and I'll be looking after both of you for the first month you're working here at the Amisham Theatre. I'll tell you something about the theatre now, then take you to meet two of the other staff. It's an old building and it's been modernized several times.",
