                  "to": 66.275,
                  "from": 65.075005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2770024,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I'm Jody, and I'll be looking after both of you for the first month you're working here at the Amisham Theatre.",
